			"notes": "# Sky Shaders — logo update\n\nThe supplied cloud-sky image is now the mod icon in **all ten Minecraft builds**, including the 1.20.1 compatibility build. The logo also appears in the repository README.\n\nThis update changes only the icon image and its metadata reference. Mod version numbers, executable classes, shaders, themes, settings, and dependency requirements are preserved. Every other JAR and source-archive entry was checked against its previous SHA-256 hash.\n\nDownload **one JAR matching your Minecraft version**, or extract the combined ZIP to find individual builds and source archives. Remove the previous Sky Shaders JAR before installing its replacement.\n\n- Minecraft 1.20.1: Sky Shaders 1.1.2, Java 17+, Fabric Loader 0.19.3+.\n- Minecraft 1.20.4: Sky Shaders 1.1.0, Java 17+, Fabric Loader 0.19.5+.\n- Minecraft 1.21 / 1.21.1 / 1.21.4 / 1.21.8 / 1.21.11: Sky Shaders 1.1.0, Java 21+, Fabric Loader 0.19.5+.\n- Minecraft 26.1.2 / 26.2 / 26.3: Sky Shaders 1.1.0, Java 25+, Fabric Loader 0.19.5+.\n\nInstall the matching Fabric API and Mod Menu versions listed in the [README](https://github.com/myhticc/Sky-Shaders#downloads-and-installation). Minecraft 26.2 and 26.3 effects require OpenGL; Vulkan uses vanilla sky and clouds.\n\nThe existing 1.20.1 Sodium/Sodium Extra compatibility fix is retained. No new game runtime test was needed for this image-only update; archive contents and PNG metadata were verified.\n\n**Created by x1eqn. All rights reserved.** SHA-256 checksums and a separate PNG logo are included."
