			"notes": "# Sky Shaders — Minecraft builds\n\nClient-side Fabric mod by **x1eqn**, with 9 animated sky effects, 31 color themes, and configuration through Mod Menu.\n\nChoose **one JAR matching your Minecraft version**. The combined ZIP contains all version-specific JARs and source archives; extract it first rather than placing the ZIP in `mods`.\n\n| Minecraft | Sky Shaders | Java |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1.20.1 | 1.1.2+1.20.1 | 17+ |\n| 1.20.4 | 1.1.0+1.20.4 | 17+ |\n| 1.21 | 1.1.0+1.21 | 21+ |\n| 1.21.1 | 1.1.0+1.21.1 | 21+ |\n| 1.21.4 | 1.1.0+1.21.4 | 21+ |\n| 1.21.8 | 1.1.0+1.21.8 | 21+ |\n| 1.21.11 | 1.1.0+1.21.11 | 21+ |\n| 26.1.2 | 1.1.0+26.1.2 | 25+ |\n| 26.2 | 1.1.0+26.2 | 25+ |\n| 26.3 | 1.1.0+26.3 | 25+ |\n\nInstall Fabric API and Mod Menu for your Minecraft version. Loader 0.19.3+ is required for the 1.20.1 build; other builds require 0.19.5+. See the [README](https://github.com/myhticc/Sky-Shaders#downloads-and-installation) for the tested dependency versions.\n\n**1.20.1 fixes:** version 1.1.2 supports Loader 0.19.3 and fixes the Sodium Extra sky redirect conflict. It passed startup, sky-hook coexistence, 27 effect/resolution draws, and four settings-page checks with Sodium 0.5.13 and Sodium Extra 0.5.9.\n\n**26.2 / 26.3:** OpenGL is required for the effects. Vulkan uses vanilla sky and clouds.\n\nManual in-world visual comparisons, Iris, and complete third-party modpacks have not been tested. The source includes validation helpers; detailed build and test scope is documented in the README.\n\n**License: All rights reserved.** See LICENSE in the repository. SHA-256 checksums are included with the downloads."
